1
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:26,880
<font color="#ffffff">Petch isn't a bad person.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

2
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,600
<font color="#ffffff">He just made a mistake.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

3
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:31,720
<font color="#ffffff">Petch can never be a singer again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

4
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,240
<font color="#ffffff">I finally</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

5
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:34,880
<font color="#ffffff">got my revenge.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

6
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,840
<font color="#ffffff">The jailbird singer!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

7
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,360
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, everyone!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

8
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:41,440
<font color="#ffffff">The jailbird singer is right here!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

9
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,840
<font color="#ffffff">Everyone!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

10
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:44,840
<font color="#ffffff">PREVIOUSLY</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

11
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:47,160
<font color="#ffffff">Don't ruin what we have.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

12
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,360
<font color="#ffffff">We're better off as siblings.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

13
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,160
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Dao, are you here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

14
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,400
<font color="#ffffff">Kang!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

15
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:56,720
<font color="#ffffff">You evil man!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

16
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:59,200
<font color="#ffffff">Mom, he didn't do anything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

17
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:01,320
<font color="#ffffff">-What kind of "good person" are you?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Joke?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

18
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:07,560
<font color="#ffffff">Welcome to my farm, Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

19
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:09,080
<font color="#ffffff">Beautiful, isn't it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

20
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:10,480
<font color="#ffffff">Amazing!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

21
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,720
<font color="#ffffff">Who would have thought</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

22
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:15,000
<font color="#ffffff">you would end up running a buffalo farm?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

23
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,880
<font color="#ffffff">Honestly,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

24
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:20,279
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't think</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I would run into you either.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

25
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:22,640
<font color="#ffffff">Well, the thing is,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

26
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:26,400
<font color="#ffffff">my uncle had me take care of the place.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

27
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:30,400
<font color="#ffffff">See that? What I mainly do is</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

28
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:33,200
<font color="#ffffff">raise buffaloes and cattle over there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

29
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:35,640
<font color="#ffffff">We also have fighting cocks over that way.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

30
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:38,080
<font color="#ffffff">Plus, I have a vegetable garden,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

31
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:40,640
<font color="#ffffff">an organic one.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

32
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,600
<font color="#ffffff">It's that way. I'll show you later.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

33
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,800
<font color="#ffffff">Great.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

34
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,400
<font color="#ffffff">You're actually a good man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

35
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:49,200
<font color="#ffffff">Look over there!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

36
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:51,640
<font color="#ffffff">That is my favorite buffalo, a real champ.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

37
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:58,520
<font color="#ffffff">All right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

38
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,640
<font color="#ffffff">Here we are.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

39
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,840
<font color="#ffffff">Get out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

40
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,360
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

41
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:03,840
<font color="#ffffff">Listen.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

42
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:07,280
<font color="#ffffff">Stop flattering me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

43
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:09,160
<font color="#ffffff">It will go to my head.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

44
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:11,640
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go inside and clean that wound.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

45
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,560
<font color="#ffffff">Is this your house?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

46
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:15,880
<font color="#ffffff">Sort of.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

47
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:17,320
<font color="#ffffff">It belongs to my uncle.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

48
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,560
<font color="#ffffff">See?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

49
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:21,120
<font color="#ffffff">The truth is I'm rich.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

50
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:23,000
<font color="#ffffff">All right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

51
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,520
<font color="#ffffff">All done.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

52
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,360
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you, Joke.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

53
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:32,000
<font color="#ffffff">Don't mention it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

54
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:34,040
<font color="#ffffff">I put you through a lot in the past.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

55
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,520
<font color="#ffffff">Now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

56
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:37,760
<font color="#ffffff">I've realized how bad it was.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

57
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,560
<font color="#ffffff">Right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

58
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:43,760
<font color="#ffffff">I never expected you to be helping me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

59
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:46,040
<font color="#ffffff">You've changed a lot.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

60
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:47,920
<font color="#ffffff">Petch,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

61
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,760
<font color="#ffffff">was that an insult?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

62
00:05:51,960 --> 00:05:54,520
<font color="#ffffff">But you're right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

63
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,560
<font color="#ffffff">I used to be</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

64
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:58,320
<font color="#ffffff">a real jerk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

65
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,640
<font color="#ffffff">By the way,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

66
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:03,880
<font color="#ffffff">what's your plan after this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

67
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,320
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

68
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,720
<font color="#ffffff">I'll rest for a night</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

69
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,280
<font color="#ffffff">and leave tomorrow.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

70
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:13,640
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

71
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,040
<font color="#ffffff">Where would you go?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

72
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,080
<font color="#ffffff">Right now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

73
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:21,480
<font color="#ffffff">the news about you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is blowing up everywhere.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

74
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,040
<font color="#ffffff">How about</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

75
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,000
<font color="#ffffff">you just stay here with me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

76
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:27,360
<font color="#ffffff">Okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

77
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:28,600
<font color="#ffffff">Until things blow over.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

78
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:31,480
<font color="#ffffff">Then figure it out later. Okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

79
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,320
<font color="#ffffff">But…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

80
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,400
<font color="#ffffff">I have nothing to give you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

81
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:39,080
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry about that.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Just stay for free.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

82
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:41,920
<font color="#ffffff">You've really changed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

83
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:44,240
<font color="#ffffff">You're like a whole new person.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

84
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:46,240
<font color="#ffffff">I know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

85
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,440
<font color="#ffffff">It's because of you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

86
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:52,240
<font color="#ffffff">You taught me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

87
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:55,600
<font color="#ffffff">the difference between money and kindness.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

88
00:06:57,560 --> 00:07:01,080
<font color="#ffffff">I used to take advantage of you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

89
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,440
<font color="#ffffff">I'm</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

90
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,560
<font color="#ffffff">still</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

91
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:05,960
<font color="#ffffff">so ashamed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

92
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,600
<font color="#ffffff">Forget it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

93
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,480
<font color="#ffffff">I never held a grudge.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

94
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:15,320
<font color="#ffffff">-By the way…</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

95
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,480
<font color="#ffffff">What happened to you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

96
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:19,480
<font color="#ffffff">Where did you get that scar?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

97
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:24,360
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, it's a long story.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

98
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:27,360
<font color="#ffffff">Let's just talk about it later.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

99
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:28,960
<font color="#ffffff">But now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

100
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:32,400
<font color="#ffffff">go take a shower, and then we can eat.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

101
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:34,160
<font color="#ffffff">All right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

102
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,240
<font color="#ffffff">I'll put this away.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

103
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:38,200
<font color="#ffffff">The bathroom is that way.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

104
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:56,120
<font color="#ffffff">BOONYAVEJ HOSPITAL</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

105
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,360
<font color="#ffffff">Go get some rest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

106
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:58,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'll watch over her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

107
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:02,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'm fine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

108
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,480
<font color="#ffffff">I'm good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

109
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:05,960
<font color="#ffffff">Don't be stubborn.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

110
00:08:06,520 --> 00:08:08,800
<font color="#ffffff">I know you have a lot on your mind,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

111
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:11,440
<font color="#ffffff">especially the news about Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

112
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,680
<font color="#ffffff">Dad…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

113
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:17,760
<font color="#ffffff">Petch is a good man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

114
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,880
<font color="#ffffff">While you were away,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

115
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:21,800
<font color="#ffffff">he always came to sing for her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

116
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:30,520
<font color="#ffffff">But I treated him so badly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

117
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:34,400
<font color="#ffffff">I ruined his reputation</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

118
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:37,520
<font color="#ffffff">and his future.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

119
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,440
<font color="#ffffff">It's all my fault.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

120
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,800
<font color="#ffffff">It's okay, dear.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

121
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:51,520
<font color="#ffffff">I believe it's not too late.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

122
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:56,400
<font color="#ffffff">Do you really think so?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

123
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,320
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

124
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:01,040
<font color="#ffffff">Look at her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

125
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:04,080
<font color="#ffffff">She's lying here unconscious,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

126
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:07,040
<font color="#ffffff">but I never lose hope.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

127
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,760
<font color="#ffffff">You must stay strong</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

128
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:20,800
<font color="#ffffff">and help Petch become</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">a beloved artist again.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

129
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,000
<font color="#ffffff">Okay, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

130
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,840
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, Dao.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

131
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,640
<font color="#ffffff">Hello, Mr. Nop.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

132
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:15,920
<font color="#ffffff">Come on in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

133
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:26,000
<font color="#ffffff">Has Petch contacted you at all?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

134
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:29,400
<font color="#ffffff">You know what he's like.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

135
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:32,560
<font color="#ffffff">He handles things on his own.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

136
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:34,000
<font color="#ffffff">So,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

137
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:36,560
<font color="#ffffff">don't expect him to reach out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

138
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:39,320
<font color="#ffffff">True.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

139
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:43,480
<font color="#ffffff">No one at the company</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">can reach him either.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

140
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,080
<font color="#ffffff">Or…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

141
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,920
<font color="#ffffff">Could he be with Berm?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

142
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:49,400
<font color="#ffffff">If we find Berm, we might find Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

143
00:10:50,880 --> 00:10:52,480
<font color="#ffffff">No, he's not with Berm.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

144
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:55,800
<font color="#ffffff">That's actually what I wanted to discuss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

145
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:58,240
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

146
00:10:58,320 --> 00:11:00,120
<font color="#ffffff">After the incident,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

147
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:02,680
<font color="#ffffff">I caught Berm and brought him here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

148
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:05,080
<font color="#ffffff">But before the day was even over,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

149
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,360
<font color="#ffffff">he ran away.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

150
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:09,560
<font color="#ffffff">Really?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

151
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:11,480
<font color="#ffffff">But before he fled,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

152
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,520
<font color="#ffffff">I talked to him</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

153
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,440
<font color="#ffffff">and found out</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

154
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:19,160
<font color="#ffffff">that someone was behind</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the setup to ruin Petch's name<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

155
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,920
<font color="#ffffff">at the showcase.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

156
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,240
<font color="#ffffff">Who was it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

157
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:24,040
<font color="#ffffff">Sai Kaew.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

158
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:27,600
<font color="#ffffff">That's impossible.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

159
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:30,000
<font color="#ffffff">I was just as confused as you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

160
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:32,280
<font color="#ffffff">But Berm insisted</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

161
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:36,200
<font color="#ffffff">that Sai Kaew brought him to the event.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

162
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:39,120
<font color="#ffffff">Why would she do that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

163
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,840
<font color="#ffffff">I don't get it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

164
00:11:40,920 --> 00:11:42,520
<font color="#ffffff">Neither do I.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

165
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:45,600
<font color="#ffffff">They lived under the same roof,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

166
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:47,920
<font color="#ffffff">yet she turned on him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

167
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,680
<font color="#ffffff">On top of that,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

168
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:52,240
<font color="#ffffff">she even sent men to get rid of Berm.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

169
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:56,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm so worried about Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:11:56,640 --> 00:11:59,360
<font color="#ffffff">Does he even know</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">someone is out to get him?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

171
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'm worried too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

172
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, my friend!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

173
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:19,520
<font color="#ffffff">You're so hardworking.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

174
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:25,120
<font color="#ffffff">-Wow.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Well, I'm staying at your farm.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

175
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:27,320
<font color="#ffffff">I can't just do nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

176
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:31,320
<font color="#ffffff">Wow, you're so useful.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

177
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:32,840
<font color="#ffffff">Excellent!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

178
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:34,760
<font color="#ffffff">But Petch,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

179
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:37,200
<font color="#ffffff">instead of spending time on my farm,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

180
00:12:37,280 --> 00:12:40,240
<font color="#ffffff">shouldn't you go back to making music?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

181
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,880
<font color="#ffffff">People are waiting to hear you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

182
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:46,560
<font color="#ffffff">You know how much backlash I am getting.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

183
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:48,280
<font color="#ffffff">Besides,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

184
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:50,080
<font color="#ffffff">the industry no longer welcomes me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

185
