543
00:35:36,040 --> 00:35:37,240
<font color="#ffffff">Ake!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

544
00:35:39,840 --> 00:35:41,640
<font color="#ffffff">Now, it's your turn, old man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

545
00:35:43,040 --> 00:35:44,080
<font color="#ffffff">Shoot me then!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

546
00:35:45,160 --> 00:35:46,640
<font color="#ffffff">Let karma catch up to you!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

547
00:35:59,160 --> 00:36:01,240
<font color="#ffffff">You won't die in vain, old man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

548
00:36:02,480 --> 00:36:04,040
<font color="#ffffff">It will be much more satisfying</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

549
00:36:04,760 --> 00:36:07,400
<font color="#ffffff">if Petch believes</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">his father died because of him.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

550
00:36:57,080 --> 00:36:58,000
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

551
00:36:58,600 --> 00:36:59,600
<font color="#ffffff">Petch,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

552
00:36:59,680 --> 00:37:01,320
<font color="#ffffff">why are you up so early?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

553
00:37:03,280 --> 00:37:04,920
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

554
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:06,640
<font color="#ffffff">I suddenly woke up</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

555
00:37:06,720 --> 00:37:08,040
<font color="#ffffff">and couldn't sleep.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

556
00:37:08,120 --> 00:37:09,080
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

557
00:37:09,160 --> 00:37:11,240
<font color="#ffffff">I guess I'm excited that my dad is coming.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

558
00:37:11,320 --> 00:37:12,200
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

559
00:37:12,880 --> 00:37:14,440
<font color="#ffffff">Your dad is coming here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

560
00:37:14,520 --> 00:37:15,520
<font color="#ffffff">Right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

561
00:37:16,440 --> 00:37:17,800
<font color="#ffffff">He'll come later this morning.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

562
00:37:20,840 --> 00:37:22,040
<font color="#ffffff">It's almost dawn anyway.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

563
00:37:23,040 --> 00:37:24,360
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go cook something for him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

564
00:37:29,720 --> 00:37:31,080
<font color="#ffffff">-Joke.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

565
00:37:32,480 --> 00:37:34,040
<font color="#ffffff">I only told my dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

566
00:37:34,880 --> 00:37:36,080
<font color="#ffffff">No one else.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

567
00:37:38,640 --> 00:37:41,520
<font color="#ffffff">Petch! Wait a second. Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

568
00:37:42,600 --> 00:37:44,240
<font color="#ffffff">Damn!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

569
00:37:44,320 --> 00:37:45,440
<font color="#ffffff">What should I do now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

570
00:37:46,160 --> 00:37:48,800
<font color="#ffffff">I already invited Dao.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

571
00:37:53,080 --> 00:37:54,320
<font color="#ffffff">Damn it, Joke!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

572
00:38:21,640 --> 00:38:22,760
<font color="#ffffff">Dad!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

573
00:38:33,280 --> 00:38:34,400
<font color="#ffffff">Hi, Dad!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

574
00:38:43,080 --> 00:38:44,600
<font color="#ffffff">Petch, listen to me first.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

575
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:49,200
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not angry with you,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

576
00:38:51,040 --> 00:38:52,360
<font color="#ffffff">but I don't think</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

577
00:38:53,240 --> 00:38:54,600
<font color="#ffffff">we have to talk anymore.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

578
00:38:56,560 --> 00:38:57,560
<font color="#ffffff">Don't lie.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

579
00:38:58,760 --> 00:39:00,120
<font color="#ffffff">Who's the one lying here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

580
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:06,040
<font color="#ffffff">Petch,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

581
00:39:06,920 --> 00:39:08,240
<font color="#ffffff">I know I was wrong.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

582
00:39:09,760 --> 00:39:11,920
<font color="#ffffff">I falsified your background information.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

583
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:13,880
<font color="#ffffff">I just want to apologize.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

584
00:39:15,080 --> 00:39:16,440
<font color="#ffffff">No need.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

585
00:39:16,520 --> 00:39:17,880
<font color="#ffffff">Petch,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

586
00:39:17,960 --> 00:39:20,560
<font color="#ffffff">you can blame me all you want,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

587
00:39:20,640 --> 00:39:22,560
<font color="#ffffff">but please go back to singing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

588
00:39:23,240 --> 00:39:26,560
<font color="#ffffff">Many fans out there</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">don't care about your past.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

589
00:39:27,240 --> 00:39:28,720
<font color="#ffffff">This isn't about the fans.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

590
00:39:29,600 --> 00:39:30,840
<font color="#ffffff">Do you even realize</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

591
00:39:31,480 --> 00:39:34,920
<font color="#ffffff">what it means to clean up my record?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

592
00:39:37,640 --> 00:39:38,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'll tell you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

593
00:39:40,080 --> 00:39:41,160
<font color="#ffffff">It means you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

594
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:44,920
<font color="#ffffff">can't accept who I really am.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

595
00:39:45,640 --> 00:39:46,840
<font color="#ffffff">You, Dao,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

596
00:39:46,920 --> 00:39:48,360
<font color="#ffffff">and not anyone else!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

597
00:39:50,960 --> 00:39:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">Petch,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

598
00:39:52,800 --> 00:39:54,480
<font color="#ffffff">don't blame her.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

599
00:39:55,280 --> 00:39:57,120
<font color="#ffffff">She didn't mean it that way.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

600
00:39:57,200 --> 00:39:59,480
<font color="#ffffff">-She wants the best for you.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Stop it!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

601
00:40:03,960 --> 00:40:05,600
<font color="#ffffff">I've learned my lesson.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

602
00:40:06,600 --> 00:40:09,040
<font color="#ffffff">I don't need your fake goodwill anymore.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

603
00:40:13,520 --> 00:40:15,000
<font color="#ffffff">Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

604
00:40:19,880 --> 00:40:20,720
<font color="#ffffff">Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

605
00:40:21,760 --> 00:40:22,600
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Dao,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

606
00:40:23,680 --> 00:40:25,200
<font color="#ffffff">I'm so sorry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

607
00:40:25,920 --> 00:40:26,840
<font color="#ffffff">I shouldn't have</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

608
00:40:27,440 --> 00:40:28,760
<font color="#ffffff">asked you to come.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

609
00:40:29,600 --> 00:40:31,520
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't realize Petch</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

610
00:40:32,160 --> 00:40:33,800
<font color="#ffffff">would take it this hard.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

611
00:40:35,480 --> 00:40:36,520
<font color="#ffffff">He's not wrong.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

612
00:40:38,040 --> 00:40:39,840
<font color="#ffffff">I started all of this,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

613
00:40:41,160 --> 00:40:42,920
<font color="#ffffff">so no wonder he's lashing out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

614
00:40:43,520 --> 00:40:46,480
<font color="#ffffff">I really want to smack him on the head.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

615
00:40:46,560 --> 00:40:48,480
<font color="#ffffff">He has someone who cares</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">so much about him,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

616
00:40:48,560 --> 00:40:50,800
<font color="#ffffff">but he's still acting crazy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

617
00:40:50,880 --> 00:40:52,680
<font color="#ffffff">I just don't understand him at all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

618
00:40:53,640 --> 00:40:55,440
<font color="#ffffff">Joke! This is bad!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

619
00:40:55,520 --> 00:40:56,960
<font color="#ffffff">What is it, Wat?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

620
00:40:57,040 --> 00:40:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">Look at this news.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

621
00:40:58,160 --> 00:40:59,200
<font color="#ffffff">It just came out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

622
00:40:59,840 --> 00:41:00,720
<font color="#ffffff">What news?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

623
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:04,200
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Moving on to a suicide case.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

624
00:41:04,280 --> 00:41:11,040
<font color="#ffffff"><i>The deceased is the father</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>of a rising new artist.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

625
00:41:11,120 --> 00:41:14,600
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Rescue workers discovered</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>the body of Mr. Nop Panjin,</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

626
00:41:14,680 --> 00:41:17,240
<font color="#ffffff"><i>who had committed suicide inside his taxi.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

627
00:41:17,320 --> 00:41:18,800
<font color="#ffffff"><i>During the examination,</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

628
00:41:18,880 --> 00:41:22,920
<font color="#ffffff"><i>police found a key text message</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>on his phone</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

629
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:26,240
<font color="#ffffff"><i>expressing grief over his son,</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

630
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:28,400
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Petch Panjin,</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

631
00:41:28,480 --> 00:41:30,640
<font color="#ffffff"><i>the artist currently involved in a scandal</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

632
00:41:30,720 --> 00:41:33,680
<font color="#ffffff"><i>that brought his music career to a halt.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

633
00:41:34,880 --> 00:41:35,880
<font color="#ffffff">Mr. Nop!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

634
00:41:37,040 --> 00:41:37,920
<font color="#ffffff">Mr. Nop!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

635
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:40,000
<font color="#ffffff">I can't believe he would do this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

636
00:41:42,680 --> 00:41:43,600
<font color="#ffffff">Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

637
00:41:44,480 --> 00:41:46,400
<font color="#ffffff">-Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Ms. Dao!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

638
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:47,400
<font color="#ffffff">Thanks.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

639
00:42:27,400 --> 00:42:28,440
<font color="#ffffff">Hello?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

640
00:42:28,520 --> 00:42:29,680
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, this is Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

641
00:42:29,760 --> 00:42:31,560
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I'm calling from the police station.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

642
00:42:32,240 --> 00:42:34,800
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I've been trying to reach you,</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>but couldn't.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

643
00:42:36,200 --> 00:42:37,560
<font color="#ffffff">What is this about?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

644
00:42:37,640 --> 00:42:39,880
<font color="#ffffff">I'm so sorry for your loss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

645
00:42:39,960 --> 00:42:43,160
<font color="#ffffff">Your father, Mr. Nop Panjin,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">has passed away.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

646
00:42:46,000 --> 00:42:47,480
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

647
00:42:47,560 --> 00:42:48,760
<font color="#ffffff">What happened to my dad?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

648
00:42:48,840 --> 00:42:50,360
<font color="#ffffff">He shot himself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

649
00:42:50,440 --> 00:42:52,640
<font color="#ffffff">We need a relative to come</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and claim the body<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

650
00:42:52,720 --> 00:42:54,160
<font color="#ffffff">for the funeral arrangements.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

651
00:43:05,120 --> 00:43:07,360
<font color="#ffffff">Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

652
00:43:12,520 --> 00:43:14,760
<font color="#ffffff">Petch! Ms. Dao, let's hurry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

653
00:43:14,840 --> 00:43:16,160
<font color="#ffffff">Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

654
00:43:17,560 --> 00:43:18,400
<font color="#ffffff">Petch!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

655
00:43:31,160 --> 00:43:32,560
<font color="#ffffff"><i>But remember.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

656
00:43:33,320 --> 00:43:35,360
<font color="#ffffff">No matter what happens,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

657
00:43:35,440 --> 00:43:37,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm always on your side.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

658
00:43:38,400 --> 00:43:39,520
<font color="#ffffff">I love you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

659
00:43:39,600 --> 00:43:41,160
<font color="#ffffff">I love you too, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

660
00:43:42,400 --> 00:43:43,960
<font color="#ffffff">See you tomorrow.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

661
00:43:44,720 --> 00:43:45,720
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Okay, son.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

662
00:43:46,840 --> 00:43:48,440
<font color="#ffffff">Why did tomorrow never come?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

663
00:43:50,360 --> 00:43:51,520
<font color="#ffffff">Dad!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

664
00:43:52,200 --> 00:43:54,000
<font color="#ffffff">Dad!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

665
00:44:01,320 --> 00:44:03,600
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you have to leave me, Dad?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

666
00:44:05,600 --> 00:44:07,360
<font color="#ffffff">No!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

667
00:44:18,080 --> 00:44:19,400
<font color="#ffffff">Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

668
00:44:22,840 --> 00:44:24,080
<font color="#ffffff">Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

669
00:44:27,080 --> 00:44:28,360
<font color="#ffffff">I love you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

670
00:44:28,440 --> 00:44:31,000
<font color="#ffffff">I…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

671
00:44:36,320 --> 00:44:38,000
<font color="#ffffff">Dad…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

672
00:44:50,920 --> 00:44:54,000
<font color="#ffffff">TAXI DRIVER, FOUND DEAD IN THE WOODS</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

673
00:44:55,520 --> 00:44:56,920
<font color="#ffffff">Mr. Nop!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

674
00:44:59,880 --> 00:45:01,640
<font color="#ffffff">No, it can't be true.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

675
00:45:03,920 --> 00:45:06,080
<font color="#ffffff">He would never commit suicide.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

676
00:45:17,080 --> 00:45:18,160
<font color="#ffffff">You monster!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

677
00:45:18,760 --> 00:45:20,600
<font color="#ffffff">You killed Mr. Nop!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

678
00:45:20,680 --> 00:45:23,240
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you kill him? You're not human!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

679
00:45:23,320 --> 00:45:24,320
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

680
00:45:27,360 --> 00:45:29,000
<font color="#ffffff">You're asking for it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

681
00:45:30,200 --> 00:45:31,520
<font color="#ffffff">He was just an old man</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

682
00:45:32,200 --> 00:45:34,000
<font color="#ffffff">grieving over his son,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

683
00:45:34,080 --> 00:45:35,360
<font color="#ffffff">so he killed himself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

684
00:45:36,640 --> 00:45:37,920
<font color="#ffffff">You're lying!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

685
00:45:38,000 --> 00:45:39,480
<font color="#ffffff">You killed him!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

686
00:45:39,560 --> 00:45:40,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'll get the cops to arrest you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

687
00:45:43,960 --> 00:45:45,560
<font color="#ffffff">Look at your pathetic face.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

688
00:45:46,480 --> 00:45:47,720
<font color="#ffffff">What can you do to me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

689
00:45:48,880 --> 00:45:50,480
<font color="#ffffff">Where is your evidence?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

690
00:45:57,760 --> 00:45:58,720
<font color="#ffffff">I hate you!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

691
00:45:58,800 --> 00:46:00,240
<font color="#ffffff">We're done!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

692
00:46:02,880 --> 00:46:04,080
<font color="#ffffff">The more you hate me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

693
00:46:04,920 --> 00:46:06,160
<font color="#ffffff">the more I like it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

694
00:46:07,760 --> 00:46:09,560
<font color="#ffffff">Until death do us part.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

695
00:46:10,480 --> 00:46:12,440
<font color="#ffffff">You can't break up with me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

696
00:46:15,280 --> 00:46:16,840
<font color="#ffffff">What are you doing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

697
00:46:16,920 --> 00:46:17,760
<font color="#ffffff">Stop it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

698
00:46:18,440 --> 00:46:19,360
<font color="#ffffff">Don't!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

699
00:46:19,440 --> 00:46:20,720
<font color="#ffffff">You bastard!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

700
00:46:43,480 --> 00:46:45,000
<font color="#ffffff">Mr. Nop,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

701
00:46:45,680 --> 00:46:48,480
<font color="#ffffff">I can't believe you left us like this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

702
00:46:50,200 --> 00:46:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">But no matter what happens,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

703
00:46:53,240 --> 00:46:56,240
<font color="#ffffff">I'll always remember</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the nice things you did.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

704
00:46:58,800 --> 00:47:00,560
<font color="#ffffff">You may be gone,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

705
00:47:02,040 --> 00:47:05,440
<font color="#ffffff">but you'll live on in my memory forever.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

706
00:47:18,000 --> 00:47:19,160
<font color="#ffffff">Dao.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

707
00:47:26,760 --> 00:47:27,720
<font color="#ffffff">What did you say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

708
00:47:27,800 --> 00:47:29,120
<font color="#ffffff">You found Petch?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

709
00:47:30,000 --> 00:47:30,880
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

710
00:47:32,480 --> 00:47:33,360
<font color="#ffffff">Really?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

711
00:47:34,120 --> 00:47:34,960
<font color="#ffffff">Hold on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

712
00:47:35,040 --> 00:47:37,480
<font color="#ffffff">We're in a temple. Have some respect.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

713
00:47:38,080 --> 00:47:39,080
<font color="#ffffff">Sorry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

714
00:47:39,160 --> 00:47:40,200
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Dao,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

715
00:47:40,800 --> 00:47:41,800
<font color="#ffffff">is it really true?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

716
00:47:41,880 --> 00:47:44,240
<font color="#ffffff">I pray every day for Petch to be found.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

717
00:47:44,320 --> 00:47:47,000
<font color="#ffffff">But where is he right now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

718
00:47:48,640 --> 00:47:49,480
<font color="#ffffff">Dao,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

719
00:47:50,080 --> 00:47:52,480
<font color="#ffffff">does Petch know about his father yet?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

720
00:47:53,440 --> 00:47:54,480
<font color="#ffffff">He does.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

721
00:47:54,560 --> 00:47:58,000
<font color="#ffffff">He went to see the abbot.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">He should be here shortly.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

722
00:48:01,320 --> 00:48:04,480
<font color="#ffffff">I would like to invite you to lead</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">my dad's funeral chanting ceremony.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

723
00:48:04,560 --> 00:48:05,760
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

724
00:48:05,840 --> 00:48:07,840
<font color="#ffffff">I will certainly be there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

725
00:48:10,040 --> 00:48:12,400
<font color="#ffffff">I can hardly believe</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

726
00:48:12,480 --> 00:48:15,000
<font color="#ffffff">your father would make such a choice.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

727
00:48:15,680 --> 00:48:17,280
<font color="#ffffff">I can't believe it either.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

728
00:48:20,600 --> 00:48:22,080
<font color="#ffffff">Just last night,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

729
00:48:22,720 --> 00:48:24,600
<font color="#ffffff">he told me he would come and see me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

730
00:48:26,360 --> 00:48:28,680
<font color="#ffffff">There was no sign he would commit suicide.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

731
00:48:30,440 --> 00:48:31,560
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

732
00:48:32,320 --> 00:48:33,400
<font color="#ffffff">Did your dad</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

733
00:48:34,200 --> 00:48:35,680
<font color="#ffffff">ever have trouble with anyone?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

734
00:48:39,560 --> 00:48:41,320
<font color="#ffffff">The cops checked everything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

735
00:48:42,080 --> 00:48:43,640
<font color="#ffffff">He had no conflict with anyone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

736
00:48:46,840 --> 00:48:48,480
<font color="#ffffff">Except for…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

737
00:48:50,080 --> 00:48:51,160
<font color="#ffffff">All right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

738
00:48:51,800 --> 00:48:54,200
<font color="#ffffff">If you don't want to say it,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you don't have to.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

739
00:48:54,280 --> 00:48:55,480
<font color="#ffffff">I understand, man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

740
00:48:58,760 --> 00:49:00,640
<font color="#ffffff">He must have been hurt,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

741
00:49:03,560 --> 00:49:05,120
<font color="#ffffff">but he never said a word.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

742
00:49:09,440 --> 00:49:11,400
<font color="#ffffff">I just have to accept the truth…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

743
00:49:13,280 --> 00:49:16,080
<font color="#ffffff">that I am the reason he is gone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

744
00:49:25,600 --> 00:49:27,080
<font color="#ffffff">Poor Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

745
00:49:27,760 --> 00:49:29,840
<font color="#ffffff">His life is just one crisis after another.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

746
00:49:31,040 --> 00:49:32,640
<font color="#ffffff">Truly, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

747
00:49:32,720 --> 00:49:34,760
<font color="#ffffff">Not long ago, he lost his best friend,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

748
00:49:34,840 --> 00:49:36,240
<font color="#ffffff">and now, his father.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

749
00:49:36,320 --> 00:49:37,440
<font color="#ffffff">Exactly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

750
00:49:37,520 --> 00:49:39,880
<font color="#ffffff">I'm worried about</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">whether he can handle all this.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

751
00:49:41,280 --> 00:49:45,080
<font color="#ffffff">Let's just let Petch</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">take care of the funeral first.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

752
00:49:45,160 --> 00:49:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">After that, I'll schedule a meeting.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

753
00:49:47,040 --> 00:49:48,280
<font color="#ffffff">-Got it.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Okay.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

754
00:49:52,000 --> 00:49:53,080
<font color="#ffffff">Petch is here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

755
00:50:02,760 --> 00:50:03,880
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry for your loss.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

756
00:50:05,920 --> 00:50:06,960
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

757
00:50:07,680 --> 00:50:08,520
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

758
00:50:11,240 --> 00:50:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go pay my respects to Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

759
00:50:20,960 --> 00:50:22,520
<font color="#ffffff">Joke?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

760
00:50:26,120 --> 00:50:27,800
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

761
00:50:30,280 --> 00:50:33,760
<font color="#ffffff">A sidekick has got to stick</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with the hero, right?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

762
00:50:33,840 --> 00:50:34,720
<font color="#ffffff">I came with Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

763
00:50:35,960 --> 00:50:37,160
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

764
00:50:37,240 --> 00:50:38,480
<font color="#ffffff">Petch is here too?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

765
00:50:41,760 --> 00:50:43,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go back to singing</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

766
00:50:44,440 --> 00:50:45,400
<font color="#ffffff">for my dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

767
00:50:45,480 --> 00:50:46,600
<font color="#ffffff">NEXT EPISODE</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

768
00:50:46,680 --> 00:50:48,440
<font color="#ffffff">I'll crush him to pieces</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

769
00:50:49,040 --> 00:50:50,640
<font color="#ffffff">and send him to jail.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

770
00:50:50,720 --> 00:50:51,760
<font color="#ffffff">-Let go of me!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Drink!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

771
00:50:51,840 --> 00:50:52,960
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

772
00:50:53,040 --> 00:50:54,240
<font color="#ffffff">Don't mess with my girl.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

773
00:50:54,320 --> 00:50:56,600
<font color="#ffffff">Did you meet with Berm?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

774
00:50:57,200 --> 00:50:59,400
<font color="#ffffff">Why ask if you already know?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

775
00:50:59,480 --> 00:51:00,760
<font color="#ffffff">I remember that day,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

776
00:51:00,840 --> 00:51:02,440
<font color="#ffffff">Nop rushed to see Sai Kaew.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

777
00:51:03,840 --> 00:51:05,360
<font color="#ffffff">Sai Kaew?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

778
00:51:16,680 --> 00:51:22,000
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I wish I knew if I ever crossed your mind</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

779
00:51:23,240 --> 00:51:27,560
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I wish I knew if you heard the whisper</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

780
00:51:28,960 --> 00:51:34,920
<font color="#ffffff"><i>For my heart is crying out my love</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>It's deep and true</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

781
00:51:35,000 --> 00:51:40,040
<font color="#ffffff"><i>But never reaching you</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

782
00:51:40,960 --> 00:51:46,040
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I know that it simply cannot be</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

783
00:51:47,240 --> 00:51:52,040
<font color="#ffffff"><i>And I never want to cause you misery</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

784
00:51:53,640 --> 00:51:58,720
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I'm just an ordinary man</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Worth nothing at all</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

785
00:51:59,320 --> 00:52:03,800
<font color="#ffffff"><i>And I never want to make</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Your teardrops fall</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

786
00:52:03,880 --> 00:52:04,800
<font color="#ffffff">Subtitle translation by: Jarut K.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>
